# JavaScript Snippet for Playwright Automation

```javascript
// Wait for element to be visible
const element = await page.waitForSelector('#submit-button', { state: 'visible' }); 

// Click the element
await element.click();

// Fill in a form field
await page.fill('#username', 'testuser');
```

